  "cited_article_id": "search-update-pharmacy-directory",
  "reply": "To add a pharmacy that isn’t in the national directory, open the patient’s chart (Patients > Chart > Demographics) and go to the Pharmacy tab. Click **Add Custom Pharmacy**, fill in the required fields (Name, Address, Phone, Fax), and then click **Save Entry**. After saving, you can set it as the patient’s preferred pharmacy. Only staff with Medical Assistant or Provider roles can perform this action."
}
